countries-110m.json is the 110m countries file from world-atlas 2.0.2
(https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas), built from Natural Earth
Admin 0 country boundaries.

Natural Earth data is in the public domain.
https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/

